  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing UNSCR 1325 through the media</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at: Increased participation of women in and strengthened gender perspective on conflict resolution, peacebuilding and post-conflict reconstruction processes.  Media reports more frequently and in a more gender and conflict sensitive way on conflict-related issues. Women, in particular from excluded groups and/or conflict-affected areas, participate to a higher extent in the public debate on issues related to conflict and peacebuilding</narrative>
  </description>
